。视频全程不能出现文字文案、不能出现logo、不能出现人声独白、不能出现不合理的事物、拒绝AI感的僵硬，人物言行表情自然真实。\n#对应不同的场景，每个场景里除了主角外应该合理的存在一些路人旁人。模特跟旁人也是有互动的，眼神和动作上的互动，模特的表情也是应该有变化有情绪递进的。\n#视频像一场真正的日常拍摄，自然的人类行为，现实世界的相机缺陷，真实的生活记录摄影。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [90], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 138], "pos": [3565.959716796875, 526.1305541992188], "widgets_values": ["lanczos"], "inputs": [{"name": "image_1", "link": 87, "label": "图像_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_2", "link": 88, "label": "图像_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_3", "link": 89, "label": "图像_3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_4", "label": "图像_4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_5", "label": "图像_5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_5"}, {"widget": {"name": "method"}, "name": "method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "方法"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "ImageBatchMultiple+", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageBatchMultiple+"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [32], "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["", "720p", "15", true, "16:9", false, 951929415, "randomize", true, "all", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 70, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shap